; Amatrix catalog description: the built-in (English) strings.
; Escapes as in C: \n, \33 (ESC, MUI text codes), \", \xNN.
; New strings go at the end; IDs must not change once released.
; tools/catalog.py makes gui/amatrix_strings.h and the .catalog files from this.
